  "brief": {
    "zh": "在两张营地图上都把天线和电芯送到东边的无线电站。第二张图把山脊、巡车和货物都上下翻了个面，无线电站还在东边。营地指南针的 outward 指向山上，inward 指向山脚。用同一程序通过两图。限 46 回合。",
    "en": "Take the antenna and cell to the eastern radio station on both camp maps. The second map flips the ridge, trolley and cargo upside down. The radio station is still in the east. The camp compass gives outward for uphill and inward for downhill. One program must finish both maps. You have 46 turns."
